[{"key":"0946kxw1w3kugc","text":"Sneaky pawn trick! A pawn that jumps two steps past yours can be caught, as if it moved only one."},{"key":"1ca9w4z0qomeyj","text":"Every square has a name, like e four: the file letter, then the rank number."},{"key":"1lxl0nb0toyfeb","text":"Every square has a name: its letter, then its number. This one is e four!"},{"key":"18yrstk090re6o","text":"Play full games together, and let your kid take back one move each game."},{"key":"1k1ldlc1ryp88e","text":"Stalemate: the king can't move, but he's NOT in check. That's a tie!"},{"key":"0jqa5ks10x0u4a","text":"Black's pawn just jumped two steps! Catch it with the sneaky trick."},{"key":"1xt450b12bf5jz","text":"Your king is in check! Find every way out: run, block and capture."},{"key":"1y1m3130trzsqd","text":"A rook can zoom all the way across the board, but it can't jump!"},{"key":"0gc7f2o0hq5mqw","text":"This is a pawn. Pawns march straight ahead, one step at a time."},{"key":"0awonng139tnsi","text":"This knight statue is sleeping. The glowing squares are lava!"},{"key":"1rlrv5112ucveb","text":"What's your name? A grown-up can type it, or pick a fun name!"},{"key":"05lijia03o5pei","text":"Rooks go in straight lines, until something is in the way."},{"key":"1gwtzgc0nvxwve","text":"If your king is in danger, the bells will ring. Ding ding!"},{"key":"06q4y141fps7d4","text":"The rook attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"038yjq60g9q3dy","text":"Capture the Crown! Whoever captures the other king wins."},{"key":"0acaajt0p7vr49","text":"You kept trying, even when it was tricky. That is brave!"},{"key":"1buegl41sw1tau","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your bishop. Try again!"},{"key":"1afzn3g1tcae94","text":"Olive found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1ab8xoh0hj7tvl","text":"A pawn that jumped two steps can be taken in passing."},{"key":"0q958fm1mp4p88","text":"Tap every piece that can capture the pawn, then Done."},{"key":"0vzdt7r1ce8t23","text":"A knight in the corner has only 2 squares to hop to."},{"key":"1aswiqa1wfyw1e","text":"Her friends are in the way! Where can the queen go?"},{"key":"0xh1s680okd31k","text":"Every move eats a snack. Guarded snacks bite back!"},{"key":"04g7v18086tj8w","text":"Oops, Shelly left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1vgi76r1gbvja7","text":"Chess board. Use the arrow keys and Enter to move."},{"key":"17046my1k2svhm","text":"Oops, Ember left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1gjm55e0ng2t08","text":"Your first checkmate! The king had nowhere to go."},{"key":"0v26n2o1vuqkxy","text":"Oops, Shelly left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1b1bzog0qrp9fu","text":"Oops, Fern left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"12557m903go4jd","text":"The bishop gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"079rj7p0zqdb8h","text":"Good trade? Do you get more candy than you give?"},{"key":"084tix51o73e27","text":"Oops, Tuck left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1394rsx1fli3ff","text":"Oops, Bruno left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0m34hqy00pq6wy","text":"No legal moves and no check: stalemate, a draw."},{"key":"0xcdnes1skbxo2","text":"What does the knight want? Keep your rook safe!"},{"key":"116ux2y1p4syj4","text":"Center pawns, knights out, bishops out, castle!"},{"key":"0sfcux00hzxmh8","text":"Oops, Tuck left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0g31exe16yzeps","text":"The king is stuck behind his pawns. Checkmate!"},{"key":"10bl9l018elgow","text":"Find as many squares as you can in 30 seconds!"},{"key":"0c52e3m1jn0ykk","text":"The queen is the strongest piece on the board."},{"key":"0i5hvoe1mzcefw","text":"Oops, Hop left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"02naimb1q8tgnt","text":"Your king is in check! Get him out of danger."},{"key":"0j4cjer02pshq7","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the king can go."},{"key":"02zyq1i0ne5x98","text":"Find a move that attacks two things at once!"},{"key":"0rwcfvk04x1r06","text":"Bonus: how many squares does the rook reach?"},{"key":"1u20jnd1wjh6wh","text":"Shelly's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"0tqkvon1arraxh","text":"A bishop stays on one square color forever."},{"key":"0fq0bwx176c5ab","text":"Bruno is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"12uv9va0ze2cjq","text":"Every glowing piece can gobble the cookie!"},{"key":"1o3ps2o0o5q1qg","text":"Find the queen move that gobbles the rook!"},{"key":"1t319qb1gsju1n","text":"Every knight hop lands on the other color."},{"key":"0blfde509nylsb","text":"Fern's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"1jqojnm1xy8wx6","text":"Pawns walk straight, but they eat slanty!"},{"key":"1nbn1t2030hb4u","text":"Good game! Every game makes you stronger."},{"key":"0annqfb01ip3y7","text":"Hop has the whole army now. Can you win?"},{"key":"1pf46lc1vlnrcs","text":"Another jumpy pawn! Catch it in passing."},{"key":"0nddebx1fpepaj","text":"Every buddy you play makes you stronger."},{"key":"03xd07g0op20u2","text":"The queen has lots of checks. Find one!"},{"key":"14appif1oaxap1","text":"You made a knight with check. Surprise!"},{"key":"08ncuvq07qgb50","text":"First the letter a, then the number 2."},{"key":"00blmkl07qgb7r","text":"First the letter a, then the number 5."},{"key":"0d7yobe0u81ngm","text":"First the letter b, then the number 3."},{"key":"1mjsbd31gpmzph","text":"First the letter c, then the number 1."},{"key":"1doq5rl1gpmzuz","text":"First the letter c, then the number 7."},{"key":"1qgpdve0464a4q","text":"First the letter d, then the number 5."},{"key":"036slmv0qnpmdl","text":"First the letter e, then the number 3."},{"key":"0h8mazw1d5aymg","text":"First the letter f, then the number 1."},{"key":"0q3ogle1d5ayry","text":"First the letter f, then the number 7."},{"key":"0kacvtb00ls91p","text":"First the letter g, then the number 5."},{"key":"0ey16tk0n3dlak","text":"First the letter h, then the number 3."},{"key":"1czb1gh1dg8a2t","text":"Play with a friend! Pick how to start."},{"key":"03tlqr11vd85pt","text":"Optional. Replaces the times question."},{"key":"1trcfmu173l8lg","text":"You win 10, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1889v250xge0u9","text":"Check means a piece attacks the king."},{"key":"19treka16cv67w","text":"Two snacks. Which one is safe to eat?"},{"key":"027gtdw02qmr9s","text":"Great playing! Keep going on the map."},{"key":"0x6xr0c1kl7qn0","text":"Ember made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"10561211jg3t07","text":"You win 4, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"0aac1n9061ec5j","text":"Look at the king. Who can reach him?"},{"key":"12funu41vfj4lg","text":"Kings and pawns! Make a queen first!"},{"key":"0a3xks1098a09d","text":"One quick one from before. Let's go!"},{"key":"1o1j2gi02smrf0","text":"That's the bishop! Find the knight."},{"key":"060g0l7084m7u5","text":"Stuck. Reset and try another order."},{"key":"0291ooe1f2fv70","text":"Two rooks make a ladder. Checkmate!"},{"key":"02srfwq15sckis","text":"Pawns walk straight but eat slanty!"},{"key":"1xsb0f913rnl2d","text":"That's the knight! Find the queen."},{"key":"0jebazm0697uq6","text":"That one stayed still. Look again!"},{"key":"1bu7ly51ulkwll","text":"You can never castle out of check."},{"key":"1raxq0602jsura","text":"The Crown. Beat Olive to graduate."},{"key":"17n0ejr174cs51","text":"The queen starts on her own color!"},{"key":"08ner1s0yn0fww","text":"That's the king! Find the knight."},{"key":"16a3d0s1gb6rww","text":"That's the bishop! Find the king."},{"key":"0eifl3p0wko78d","text":"That's the pawn! Find the bishop."},{"key":"0hbcuue15obme8","text":"That piece would hang. Try again."},{"key":"15fgbeu0tu41xc","text":"Visit all four corners... almost!"},{"key":"014wkpt1640n89","text":"Tap every square the king can go!"},{"key":"0rhfe5i03va72y","text":"A pinned piece is stuck in place."},{"key":"0ouara51r7grkf","text":"The queen goes on her own color."},{"key":"0h1koj71jluqp3","text":"Find a snack that nobody guards."},{"key":"0v42n9q069me14","text":"The king can't reach the cookie."},{"key":"1tew0de0uximjy","text":"Bishops are worth about 3 pawns."},{"key":"1o71r080489n30","text":"Turn off \"Lock Kids mode\" first."},{"key":"081yz5u1lch1q0","text":"That's the rook! Find the rook."},{"key":"1aeou0p1rrwmh7","text":"Capture the Crown. king's turn."},{"key":"1uz4qal1ovlqmv","text":"Checkmate in 12 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0yxhhuj1vvd3st","text":"Ember won this time. Good game!"},{"key":"0wgfzu50cj8qv3","text":"Knights join. Checkmate to win."},{"key":"00c0qgn0dpfg4f","text":"A queen is worth about 9 pawns."},{"key":"13clgpj128iceb","text":"Race a pawn to the other side!"},{"key":"09o8d341qnpqxe","text":"Tap a piece in the tray first!"},{"key":"1r944151saj2qv","text":"Checkmate in 3 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0sjrvan0on7hd9","text":"Checkmate in 9 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"1uxphuc0rd93b2","text":"Yes! All of them can munch it!"},{"key":"02gd98e0byf3qs","text":"Light up the up-and-down road!"},{"key":"1lpq5ki1y5ur9k","text":"Develops pieces in the opening"},{"key":"00958i80t87xas","text":"Can the pawn gobble the rook?"},{"key":"01u9ep81qzqcak","text":"Right next door takes 3 hops!"},{"key":"14e2gev16uvpst","text":"Can your king guard the rook?"},{"key":"1idsdrj14wejpz","text":"A queen can stop eight pawns!"},{"key":"1rap5bh128c8gl","text":"Pawn war board. king's turn."},{"key":"1qk1uwk1agb3s2","text":"Pawn war board. pawn's turn."},{"key":"0twttjo1ykqge4","text":"Every move must eat a snack!"},{"key":"0v06w8j10tilt9","text":"Only 13! You found them all!"},{"key":"144a0bg1xlua1g","text":"Zoom all the way and gobble!"},{"key":"0j4a15r0zyoj4h","text":"Capture the queen on d five."},{"key":"0kz871e11dmozs","text":"Knows light and dark squares"},{"key":"0py4fzu0pshp76","text":"Let's build your Pawn Buddy!"},{"key":"0czchaz134duuz","text":"Only 2! You found them all!"},{"key":"12x7va10gxo18h","text":"Only 8! You found them all!"},{"key":"1nyc4vw1ljq3zg","text":"Capture the rook on b five."},{"key":"0v3h9820yayypa","text":"Get the king out of danger!"},{"key":"0kyw2c40rshwb4","text":"Knows what pieces are worth"},{"key":"1soupf503ie1at","text":"Where is the pawn? Tap it!"},{"key":"07b5z131vj8ogv","text":"12 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1rnpwc21k4y3qu","text":"Chess board: find the move"},{"key":"1ornxsa1roeqtw","text":"The knight can't go there."},{"key":"0x47ajr1hlnh69","text":"Look all around the piece."},{"key":"0rh91wz0p2h5ox","text":"Slide and gobble the rook!"},{"key":"1xgjxci0sdslmo","text":"Which piece is worth more?"},{"key":"0kojsvi12e3wo8","text":"Protects a piece in danger"},{"key":"032y6ne1l5u5t8","text":"I know how the pieces move"},{"key":"14hrkza0tj28z8","text":"8 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1hlq57d1s8h9tz","text":"Your pawn became a queen!"},{"key":"0kylsf00um5dp8","text":"Ember made a queen first."},{"key":"0qyny700m79m1u","text":"Queen! Eat all the pawns!"},{"key":"1gbj1s408z4lga","text":"Win a game against bishop"},{"key":"0mnw4wh0vs7n37","text":"March a pawn to the end!"},{"key":"05siz2o1o0iec8","text":"The king can't go there."},{"key":"1whqc24016zffg","text":"Fern made a queen first."},{"key":"1lw073p06adzrh","text":"Hop and catch the pawns!"},{"key":"18vp0fc0bxu9o0","text":"Moves the king correctly"},{"key":"1mtbbcd05tpll5","text":"Yes! That's the bishop!"},{"key":"00o392q0qtcc92","text":"11 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"1tv64r10h32qyz","text":"Capture the Crown board"},{"key":"16706qf16mz3k9","text":"Try moving your bishop!"},{"key":"1wijevj0msn2yt","text":"Think before you slide!"},{"key":"1qibp4g11mrcji","text":"Is the king in trouble?"},{"key":"0ay01a715w38q3","text":"Win a game against pawn"},{"key":"1etbz4a1fgk990","text":"0 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"1ionepw0t9ufmi","text":"6 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"0oeowxv0d2t07v","text":"Checkmate in 11 moves."},{"key":"0osqxk91tbrxp5","text":"Yes! The bishop moved!"},{"key":"1rjqrsv1m3wzex","text":"Tap the glowing piece!"},{"key":"0uzkdyj0vvsofx","text":"Back-rank mate in one."},{"key":"0ql7p2m1tl793y","text":"Where can the pawn go?"},{"key":"